# GreenPath – Eco-Travel Tourism Platform

A front-end tourism web application designed to present travel destinations, packages, comparisons, booking information, and travel-related content through a structured and responsive web interface.

This project was developed as a university-level software project with an **AI-assisted development workflow**, using AI tools to support implementation, debugging, code understanding, refinement, and iterative improvement.

> **Important:** AI was used as a development assistant. The website itself does not claim to contain a proprietary AI model or AI backend.

---

## Project Overview

GreenPath is a tourism-focused front-end web application that brings several travel-related functions together in one interface.

The project focuses on building a practical multi-page website with reusable styling, JavaScript-based interactions, structured content, and a consistent user experience.

The application includes pages for:

* Tourism destinations
* Travel packages
* Package details
* Booking
* Destination/package comparison
* Image gallery
* Contact information
* Main landing page

---

## Main Features

### Tourism Interface

* Tourism-focused landing page
* Destination and travel package presentation
* Structured travel information
* Visual destination content

### Package Exploration

* Travel package listings
* Package detail pages
* Information organized for easier comparison
* Tourism-oriented content presentation

### Booking Interface

* Front-end booking page
* Structured form elements
* User-oriented booking workflow

### Comparison

* Comparison interface for travel options
* Structured presentation of different choices
* JavaScript-supported interaction where applicable

### Gallery

* Image gallery for tourism content
* Visual presentation of destinations and travel experiences

### Responsive Front-End

* Structured HTML pages
* CSS-based layouts and styling
* Responsive interface considerations
* JavaScript for client-side interactions

