---

# AI-Assisted Development: What I Did

AI assistance was used as part of the development process, but the final implementation was reviewed and tested before being treated as part of the project.

The development process involved:

1. Defining the required page or feature.
2. Using AI to explore possible implementations.
3. Reviewing the generated code and explanations.
4. Integrating suitable parts into the project.
5. Testing the implementation.
6. Identifying and correcting issues.
7. Refining the final interface.

This approach provided practical experience with **human-AI collaboration in software development**.

---

# Project Scope

This is a **front-end university-level project**.

The project focuses on:

* User interface development
* Client-side functionality
* Web page structure
* Responsive design
* JavaScript interactions
* AI-assisted development

It does **not** represent a production tourism platform or a full AI backend system.

The purpose is to demonstrate practical front-end development skills and the ability to use modern AI tools responsibly as part of the development workflow.

